User Manual
Predicting Facebook Post Engagement
Project Overview

This project analyzes Facebook post data and uses machine learning models to identify factors that influence user engagement. The analysis includes:

Data cleaning and preprocessing
Exploratory data analysis (EDA)
Multiple Linear Regression
Logistic Regression
Prediction and evaluation metrics
Business recommendations based on model findings

The goal is to help marketers understand which characteristics of a Facebook post are most likely to increase engagement.

